---
NAVIGATION OPERATIONS
Choose exactly one operation that best matches what the oracle is asking for:
- cluster: group the films by a concept (semantic theme, tone, style, era, or any other axis)
- merge: combine two existing groups into one
- focus: zoom in on one group — keep only those films, discard the rest
- exclude: remove one group, keep all others
- cross_filter: restrict the view by metadata (genre, year, director)

